[Expected Approach] Using Already Set Next Rights - O(n) Time and O(1) Space We traverse the tree level by level using the already established nextRight pointers.For each level, we iterate through all nodes using a loop and set nextRight of the next level.To set next right of children of a node, for left child, we first check for the right child. And then traverse to nextRight of the current node unilt we find a node that has at least one children.
